  "solution": {
    "text": "We know that\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2012_phy_a5.png\">\r\n\r\nand $\\quad V=\\frac{Q}{4 \\pi \\varepsilon_{0} r}$\r\n$\\begin{aligned} \\text { Hence, } \\quad W &=q\\left[\\frac{Q}{4 \\pi \\varepsilon_{0} b}-\\frac{Q}{4 \\pi \\varepsilon_{0} a}\\right] \\\\ &=\\frac{Q q}{4 \\pi \\varepsilon_{0}}\\left[\\frac{a-b}{a b}\\right] \\end{aligned}$",
